===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|emir}}, from {{etyl|ar|en}} {{m|ar|أَمِير||commander, prince}}. Akin to {{term|amir|lang=en}}, {{term|Amir|lang=en}} and {{term|admiral|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɪə(ɹ)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# a [[prince]], [[commander]] or other [[leader]] or [[ruler]] in an [[Islamic]] [[nation]].
# a [[descendant]] of the [[prophet]] [[Muhammad]].

